# react-native-agent-ui

**The most complete AI agent UI for React Native.**

A framework for building production-ready AI agent experiences in React Native apps — instantly. Drop in prebuilt, composable UI, choose full-screen or an in-app bottom sheet, and wire it to your backend with minimal setup.

## Overview

`react-native-agent-ui` gives you a full agent chat interface out of the box: native and streaming markdown, generative UI, conversation threads with auto-generated titles, suggested prompts and follow-ups, full-screen or bottom-sheet presentation, tool execution, human-in-the-loop approval flows, file attachments, a highly customizable input, @mention support, and a theme system you can match to your brand. It is built on the [Vercel AI SDK](https://sdk.vercel.ai/) and designed for real mobile apps, not web wrappers.

## Features

### Agent & streaming

- **AI SDK integration** — Works with the Vercel AI SDK for model calls, streaming, and tool orchestration
- **Server-Sent Events (SSE)** — Real-time token streaming for responsive, live agent replies
- **Streaming markdown** — Renders markdown incrementally as tokens arrive — headings, lists, links, and code blocks update live without layout jumps
- **Tool calls** — Render tool invocations, arguments, and results in the conversation
- **Human-in-the-loop (HITL)** — Pause for user approval before sensitive or high-impact tool actions
- **Generative UI** — Render rich native components from agent and tool output: cards, lists, forms, charts, and custom widgets — not just text

### Content & conversation

- **Native markdown** — Fast, native markdown rendering with code blocks, syntax highlighting, tables, and copy actions — no WebView required
- **Threads** — Multi-conversation support with thread list, switching, and persistence
- **Thread title generation** — Automatically generate concise titles for new threads from the first message or conversation context
- **Suggested prompts** — Starter chips and empty-state prompts to help users begin quickly
- **Follow-ups** — Contextual “Ask next…” suggestions after each agent reply to keep the conversation flowing

### Input & attachments

- **File attachments** — Send and display images, documents, and other media in chat
- **Customizable input** — Compose and style the chat input your way: placeholders, actions, layouts, validation, and custom controls
- **Mentions** — @mention users, agents, tools, or context sources with autocomplete and rich inline rendering

### Layout & theming

- **Full-screen mode** — Dedicated agent chat screen for deep, focused conversations
- **Bottom sheet** — Modern in-screen bottom sheet UI to talk to the agent without leaving the current screen; swipe to expand, dismiss, or snap to half-height
- **Themeable components** — Customize colors, typography, spacing, and component variants to fit your app

## Quick start

```bash
npm install react-native-agent-ui
# or
yarn add react-native-agent-ui
```

```tsx
import { AgentChat, AgentSheet } from 'react-native-agent-ui';

// Full-screen agent chat with threads and suggested prompts
export function ChatScreen() {
  return (
    <AgentChat
      api="/api/chat"
      theme={yourTheme}
      suggestedPrompts={['Summarize this', 'Draft a reply', 'Explain step by step']}
    />
  );
}

// In-screen bottom sheet — agent stays on top of your existing UI
export function HomeScreen() {
  return (
    <>
      {/* your app content */}
      <AgentSheet api="/api/chat" theme={yourTheme} />
    </>
  );
}
```

